      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "In a busy dermatologic practice, it may be frustrating to encounter a vulvar disease patient, who must fully disrobe for examination. Further, the wet mounts, cultures, biopsies, and patient education required for treatment of vulvar disorders take up considerable time. However, most patients will respond to appropriate therapy, and can be very gratifying to treat."},
